OL,3,GNEWSA'Landing role on Thomas & Friends
OL,4,Awas crazy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, young actor
OL,7,FEllie-Mae Siame landed a role in a show
OL,8,Fabout one of the world's most
OL,9,Frecognisable characters ` Thomas the
OL,10,FTank Engine.
OL,12,FThe 14-year-old is the voice of Nia,
OL,13,Fthe orange and black-coloured engine
OL,14,Fnumber 18 in Thomas & Friends: Railway
OL,15,FStories.
OL,17,FA full-length YouTube special premiered
OL,18,Fon Thursday, which has already been
OL,19,Fviewed more than two million times, and
OL,20,Fit will be on Netflix from 30 September
OL,21,Fbefore a full series airs in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
